    historicalQuestions:["How should the wilderness itinerary be reconstructed?","What geographical locations can be identified with confidence?","What does Numbers preserve about Israelite camp organization?","How should the Balaam narratives be compared with the Deir Alla evidence?","What historical memory may lie behind Transjordan conflicts?"],
